第三方内容 / Third-party content
----------------------------------

本仓库包含部分第三方内容，包括但不限于：

  - 开源库与 SDK（如 Live2D Cubism SDK、pinyinlite）
  - 字体（如 MiSans）
  - 词库与公开数据整理（拼写检查词库等）
  - 图片、音频等素材（壁纸、头像、文章配图、背景音乐等）

上述内容不适用本仓库的「保留所有权利」声明，其版权与许可归各自权利人所有，
仅按原许可范围或原作者授权随本站使用。具体条款以对应目录内的 LICENSE /
NOTICE / README 文件或原始来源页面为准。

如认为某项内容侵犯了你的权利，请通过仓库 Issue 或 GitHub 账号联系，
核实后会及时移除。

The third-party content bundled in this repository — including but not limited
to open-source libraries and SDKs (e.g. Live2D Cubism SDK, pinyinlite), fonts
(e.g. MiSans), dictionaries and public datasets, and image/audio assets such as
wallpapers, avatars, article images and background music — is not covered by the
"All Rights Reserved" statement above. Copyright and licenses remain with their
respective owners, and such content is used only within the scope of the original
licenses or the authors' permission. Refer to the LICENSE / NOTICE / README files
in the corresponding directories, or the original source pages, for specific terms.

If you believe any content infringes your rights, please contact us via a
repository issue or the GitHub account, and it will be removed after verification.
